{"suttaId":"tha-ap199","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7338,7359],"vripara":"35"},"segments":{"tha-ap199:0.3":"Tindukadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap199:1.1":"“Giriduggacaro āsiṃ, makkaṭo thāmavegiko;","tha-ap199:1.3":"Phalinaṃ tindukaṃ disvā, buddhaseṭṭhaṃ anussariṃ.","tha-ap199:2.1":"“Nikkhamitvā katipāhaṃ, viciniṃ lokanāyakaṃ;","tha-ap199:2.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, siddhatthaṃ tibhavantaguṃ.","tha-ap199:3.1":"“Mama saṅkappamaññāya, satthā loke anuttaro;","tha-ap199:3.3":"Khīṇāsavasahassehi, āgacchi mama santikaṃ.","tha-ap199:4.1":"“Pāmojjaṃ janayitvāna, phalahattho upāgamiṃ;","tha-ap199:4.3":"Paṭiggahesi bhagavā, sabbaññū vadataṃ varo.","tha-ap199:5.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ phalaṃ adadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap199:5.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap199:6.1":"“Sattapaññāsakappamhi, upanandasanāmako;","tha-ap199:6.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap199:7.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap199:8.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā tindukadāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap199:9.1":"Tindukadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
